<section id="A1.SS1.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS3.6" class="ltx_text">A-A</span>3 </span>Derivation of Zero-Included MARs</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
